BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mix and Master
DTSTART:20270106T010000Z
DTEND:20270106T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20261118T003644Z
UID:40509
DESCRIPTION:<p>The last record shop in the Bronx is on its final spin. A r
 ising DJ isn&rsquo\;t ready to let the music die.<br /><br />Written by Ma
 cArthur Fellow Dominique Morisseau and directed by Kamilah Forbes\, execut
 ive producer of the Apollo Theater\, <em>Mix and Master </em>tells the sto
 ry of a music-driven clash of generations\, pulsing with hip-hop and jazz.
  As vinyl spins and tensions rise\, what begins as a battle for the shop b
 ecomes a reckoning over legacy\, survival\, and the courage it takes to st
 ay in the mix.<br /><br />Featuring live DJ sets throughout\, this Broadwa
 y world premiere turns up the volume on the fight to keep the culture aliv
 e.</p>
LOCATION:Todd Haimes Theatre\, 227 West 42nd Street\, New York NY 10036
URL:https://www.telecharge.com/Mix-And-Master-Tickets
END:VEVENT
